Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:10.40,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,The setup team can come up \Nwith ideas for the interior decor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:17.90,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,For outfits, maybe coordinate one thing with \Nthe costume team and leave the rest to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:21.09,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,The food team will decide the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:26.60,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Please come up with a budget for snacks,\N drinks, and... oh, also disposable utensils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:31.12,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,We can decide on the café rules later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.92,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Once each team has an estimate,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:35.92,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,we'll turn in our budget proposal \Nto the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:37.48,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,So thanks and do your best, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.20,Default,students,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.20,Main - Top,students,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:38.67,Default,students,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:41.72,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I guess that's all for today.\NOkay, dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:43.64,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:43.89,Default,students,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:45.86,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,I'm getting excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:46.60,Main - Top,students,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:47.69,Main - Top,students,0,0,0,,Think this'll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:49.52,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:53.22,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,Hey, since we're done early,\N wanna go do karaoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:54.99,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,Oh, the place by the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:55.67,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.28,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,Sounds fun! Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:00.54,Main - Top,Yumi,0,0,0,,Guys, wanna go do karaoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.52,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,You wanna go, too, Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.28,Main - Top,students,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.64,Main - Top,students,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.64,Main - Top,students,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:06.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry. I have some errands to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:09.04,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Yeah? Maybe next time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:13.70,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.48,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Adios!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:19.12,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,Shinjo! Too bad, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:20.81,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:29.07,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,A stepbrother is really \Nnothing more than a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:37.24,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And that's perfectly normal, because even \Nif we suddenly become siblings one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.52,0:01:39.06,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,we have no shared experience living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:43.83,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,People say that strangers \Nall begin as siblings first,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.61,0:01:46.82,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but in the case of stepsiblings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:53.00,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,they start off as strangers and \Nstay strangers until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:59.01,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,That's what I used to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:38.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an3\fad(730,690)\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H6D54D0&\b1\pos(599.385,261.068)}Episode 10 {\fs14}"Relations and {\c&H89CAEB&}Re{\c&H6D54D0&}grets"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.31,0:03:38.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:42.06,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, are you okay for time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:50.08,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yes. I called in and let them know, \Nso I don't have to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.64,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:55.39,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You said we needed to talk about the\N parent-teacher meeting, so I hurried home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:56.88,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:04:00.84,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If it didn't have to be in person, \Nyou could've just messaged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.84,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:10.41,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,But I didn't think text would get everything \Nacross, and I wanted to be sure, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:14.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure... I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:19.90,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,How are things going with Yuta-kun at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:22.33,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,How are things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:26.30,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,We're in different classes,\Nso pretty much the same as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:32.25,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,No one at school knows that \Nyou're brother and sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:36.78,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so. \NWe haven't really been telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:43.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Didn't you want to talk \Nabout my parent-teacher meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:51.84,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,The truth is that Taichi-san \Nis extremely busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.79,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I don't want to put even more pressure on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:05:00.11,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,So I was thinking of going \Nto both of your meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:06.25,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,But since my bar is so small,\N I can't really take multiple days off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:11.16,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,But if I do both meetings \Nback-to-back on the same day,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:14.68,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,the other kids would find \Nout that you're siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.86,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, that's not the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:32.43,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs18\shad0\bord0\fay-.11\c&HB9B4A9&\pos(402.667,158)}Asamura\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hAyase
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.82,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:35.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:37.22,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,What perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:38.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:43.00,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,We were just talking about what to do \Nfor your parent-teacher meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.44,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.85,0:05:51.63,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Taichi-san is extremely busy right now, \Nso I'm planning to go to both of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:52.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:54.43,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I've thought about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:06:00.83,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,and if you and Saki can schedule yours\N for different days, we'll make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.15,Default,Saki & Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:06.83,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, you haven't told anyone at school \Nthat you're brother and sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:12.22,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,So that would be safer than me\Ngoing to both on the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:15.56,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You mean you'd go all the way \Nout to our school twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.53,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:23.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But my dad isn't the only busy one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:26.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You work nights at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:30.93,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Isn't it already hard enough for you just \Nto come to our school in the afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:32.40,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:33.47,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:38.11,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I've got to get going. \NLet's go over the details later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.25,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:41.23,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:42.95,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,See you later...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:46.69,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:48.07,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I have to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.39,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:55.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:10.86,Flashback - Italics,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, that's not the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:19.16,Flashback - Italics,Akiko,0,0,0,,I don't feel like Yuta-kun \Naccepts me as his mother yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:21.91,Flashback - Italics,Akiko,0,0,0,,and that makes me a little sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:33.99,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:40.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Good timing. Want to eat together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:44.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.48,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So, about the parent-teacher meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.48,Main - Top,Yuta,0,0,0,,So, about the parent-teacher meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why don't we eat while we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:06.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:14.34,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal. It was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:15.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Glad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.11,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You're getting better at cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:19.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:28.09,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So, about those meetings...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:28.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:33.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We don't want people to know \N we're brother and sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:36.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,but that's really just for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:40.95,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I have been thinking it's kind of selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:46.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't actually have a problem with \Npeople knowing that you're my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:50.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But I know that's not for just me to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.96,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,This isn't a decision I can make alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:04.17,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But I've seen what happens \Nwhen my mom works too hard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:06.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,and the toll it starts to take on her health.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:09.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:15.60,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't want to make things any harder \Nfor my dad or for Akiko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Then we have our decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:25.05,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Let's schedule our meetings for the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.05,0:09:28.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That way, Akiko-san only \Nhas to go to school once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:30.43,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:36.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:43.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,This isn't only because \Nit's hard on her, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:47.85,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,There are other reasons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:54.86,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,that I want my mom to go \Nto both of our meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:10:01.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But I'll tell her what we decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:02.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh... Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.41,0:10:05.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks for dinner. It was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:10.19,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll take care of that. \NI'm sure you're tired from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:19.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Then let's do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:30.40,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,This is good.\N This should make them both happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:34.40,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,This isn't fair. It just isn't, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:40.70,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,I know that Dad and Akiko-san \Nreally want us to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:45.12,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The fact that you're worried \Nabout how hard my mom works
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.66,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:52.47,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's why I have to control my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.47,0:10:54.81,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,I have to put a lid on them and seal them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:58.94,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm trying so hard to erase these feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:02.88,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but I'm so touched by such a tiny gesture...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:06.15,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,We aren't strangers anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:09.56,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun is my stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:13.22,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san is my stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:17.87,Main - Top + Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:17.87,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,360)\fs20\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\3c&H444242&\c&H010000&\pos(198.399,42.958)}Friday, September 4th
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:30.00,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:33.19,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san and I talked and \Nmade the decision together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:37.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It feels unnatural to keep hiding \Nthe fact that we're siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.43,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Besides, aren't you super busy right now, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:45.72,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:49.45,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,I'm sure Akiko-san will be \Nhappy about this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:54.80,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,She said something to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:59.10,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,"I want us to be a real family. \NIt shouldn't be too hard."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:05.54,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,"Otherwise, what's the point of building \Nrelations by marrying?" Her words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:22.76,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,If Akiko-san knew you accepted \Nher as part of your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.50,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,it would make her very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:28.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:35.30,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Good morning, Dad. Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.79,0:12:37.21,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Good morning, Saki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Good morning, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't make breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:46.15,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Oh, that's okay! Why don't you eat with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:47.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.77,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Here, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:01.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It made Mom really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:03.05,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.99,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Good morning, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:14.65,Flashback - Italics,Taichi,0,0,0,,Good morning, Saki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:18.39,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It made Mom really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:27.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,"Mom."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:33.83,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,You don't say...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:36.85,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Well, that explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:37.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:42.74,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,I was surprised when you were asking\Nabout Ayase, but now it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:47.88,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,But this means I said some nasty stuff\N about your sister. Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:50.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You had no way of knowing. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:57.00,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,I was totally convinced \Nyou'd fallen for Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:02.11,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,I know. Sorry. I shouldn't make \Ncareless assumptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.97,0:14:06.94,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,But the way things are going,\N it seems like you get on fine as siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:08.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:12.68,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:16.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Isn't that kind of an uneven trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:18.01,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:19.21,Default,girl,0,0,0,,Oh, that looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:23.02,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Ah! And your salmon looks tasty, Yumicchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:27.50,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,Only if you'll trade me for some \Nof that secret family recipe karaage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:29.38,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,You've got yourself a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:30.67,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:34.82,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,You guys wanna hang out again later this month?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:38.04,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,Hey, great idea!\N Where should we go? And when?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.20,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,How about bowling? \NLet's find a day everyone's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:42.13,Default,Tomoya,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:45.54,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,Oh, bowling? It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:46.78,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.27,0:14:49.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.79,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Do you have to work? Or study?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:54.50,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't think I have any shifts scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.29,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But I always study on days I don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:15:00.35,Main - Top,somebody,0,0,0,,Oh, no wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:01.43,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Ah. So what should we do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:04.76,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,Then how about a study session?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:08.78,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,Uh, like we all meet up somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:09.47,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:11.54,Default,Tomoya,0,0,0,,How about the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:15.16,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,In that case, how about at my meowse?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:21.31,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,My parents always take my \Nbrothers out, so no problemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:23.31,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Come meow'n over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:25.06,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:26.18,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,Than it's settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:27.53,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,Thanks, Narasaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:28.33,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:29.80,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,All good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:32.28,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,That work for you, Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.61,0:15:34.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:44.81,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally! When I took my brothers \Nto the pool, it was a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.57,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,They were out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:49.29,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Once they start playing, \Nthey don't pay attention to anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.29,0:15:50.94,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,That's a big sister for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:52.83,Default,Tomoya,0,0,0,,So are we your little brothers now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.77,Default,Shinjo,0,0,0,,I mean, we did kinda go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:58.03,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure. Sometimes you \Njust want to show off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:16:01.38,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,No way. That's why you guys are still children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:02.97,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,Dang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:04.92,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,That's why I'd rather date an older guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.11,Default,Tomoya,0,0,0,,Dang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:10.59,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Okay, you're little brothers one, \No, and three! There ya go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:11.43,Default,Tomoya,0,0,0,,Number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.69,0:16:16.49,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,And you'll be my straitlaced little sis, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:16.95,Main - Top,girl,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:19.40,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Your big sister just might spoil you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't want a sister like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.34,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Wow, you really meant that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:25.95,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry, that was my honest reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:27.70,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I feel so attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:52.15,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You sure look down, my sweet junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:17:14.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs8\shad0\c&H2C3A5C&\3c&HA7BEC7&\pos(478.324,54.457)}Navigator
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:17:14.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs8\shad0\c&H2C3A5C&\3c&HA7BEC7&\pos(454.324,82.191)}When You're Searching for a Book
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:17:14.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\c&HDEFDEB&\3c&H6B8759&\b1\pos(614.019,102.457)}Rewards Points Promotion\N{\c&H5878B0&\bord1\3c&H8FB9C7&}Earn up to 30%
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:56.36,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You haven't had many shifts \Nwith Saki-chan lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:58.32,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you starting to miss her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:05.28,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Senpai, if you aren't careful, a laugh like \Nthat might turn the masses against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.99,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,There, there, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:10.17,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just tell your big sis here \Nwhat's been troubling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:14.55,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come now, open your heart and \Nnestle your poor little self in my bosom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:19.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's not the problem at all, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:23.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We're brother and sister. \NThere's no way things are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:25.62,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Like what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:29.31,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Like me being lonely because I don't\N get to work with my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:30.97,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:34.57,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I mean, she's only your {\i1}step{\i0}sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:36.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Either way, she's still my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:39.74,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,What a conventional response. \NHow uninteresting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:42.96,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,This isn't a matter of how interesting it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:48.83,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hmph. Then perhaps I'll cheer my gloomy \Njunior up with an exciting news flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:54.51,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,My college is holding an open campus \Nevent soon. You should come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:18:00.43,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,When you find yourself surrounded by pretty \Nolder girls, I'm sure you'll cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:07.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You go to a women's college, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.20,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Why, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:16.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\blur1\c&HC9EBEB&\an3\pos(647.273,195.09)\b1}S H I B U Y A   C E N T E R
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.36,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Can I help you find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:46.58,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Oh. Um, didn't I see you in the summer class?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:49.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:54.49,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Do you still go to that \Ncram school, Asamura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:58.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do. But only on weekends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Wait, "Asamura-san"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:04.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:08.67,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I'm Fujinami Kaho. \NKaho as in "summer" and "sail."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:10.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,"Sale"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:13.50,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,"Sail" as in sailing, not selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:17.42,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,That's usually enough to explain to \Npeople the kanji for writing my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.28,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, like the sail on a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.52,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,See? You got it now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.63,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:32.94,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't mean to interrupt \Nyour work. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:44.70,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Whoa! The miso soup \Nsure tastes different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.70,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Is it strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:48.83,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,No, no, it's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:51.46,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,I bet Yuta will like it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:53.87,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.57,0:19:58.06,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's good! This is true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Dad, would you like seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:02.20,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:03.08,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:22.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,990)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\fax-.2\c&H1F1E1C&\3c&H2F2828&\frz351.9\pos(341.802,142.772)\t(4360,4650,\c&H647A8C&\3c&HB7D9E8&)}Dinner for my big brother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.66,0:21:22.76,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If I really wanted to keep \Nmy distance from him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:27.20,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I wouldn't make him dinner. \NI wouldn't leave a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:30.59,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,That might be the best way to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:35.98,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But I start to wonder, and it makes me worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:40.78,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be more like breaking \Nties than keeping my distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:44.48,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't really want to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:49.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't want to avoid him completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:56.10,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And now, I'm sure it would be even harder \Nthan when we were strangers anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.77,0:22:04.70,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Am I going to wind up with regrets\N about how things turned out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:09.05,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:49.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8678DF&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 11 {\fs14}"{\c&H89CAEB&}Brother {\c&H8678DF&}and Sister"
